    "scene": "Afternoon in a small workshop that builds travelling exhibitions. Mara has arrived for a first-round interview for a summer prototype-assistant placement. Gus, an experienced exhibition maker, is interviewing her. Returned transport crates stand beside the bench. Mara has her old Android phone and two printed prototype logs. A six-slot cardboard tool tray sits under a work light; five tools are in their marked places and a wrench lies beside its empty place. Her application describes a phone prototype that checks a tool tray without internet. No demonstration or interview decision has happened yet.",
